### Section 5.6: the same collocation run with the boundary data removed,
### which is what shows that a small system residual alone does not
### establish a correct solution.  Start it from fitted_weight.dat as
### job.sh does for input_nn.dat.
###
### The Kovasznay flow: an exact steady solution of the two-dimensional
### incompressible Navier-Stokes equations, and the standard analytic
### benchmark for a flow PINN.
###
###   u = 1 - exp(lambda x) cos 2 pi y
###   v = lambda/(2 pi) exp(lambda x) sin 2 pi y
###   p = ( 1 - exp(2 lambda x) ) / 2
###   lambda = 1/(2 nu) - sqrt( 1/(4 nu^2) + 4 pi^2 )
###
### at Re = 40, so nu = 0.025 and lambda = -0.96374054.  The residual is
### the same as the cavity case; only the viscosity and the domain
### differ.  Unlike the cavity this one has an answer to compare against
### at every point, which is what makes it a check rather than a demo.
###
### The components differ in size by more than a decade -- u has an rms
### of 1.21 and v of 0.099 -- so Sys_wcomp normalises them.  Without it
### the supervised loss is about u alone.

















Init_w       Glorot_norm
Rand_seed    20260822 /
Restart      1 /   start from fitted_weight.dat (see job.sh)
Output_deriv 0 /

Nlayer       5 /
2 / (x, y)
40 /
40 /
40 /
3 / (u, v, p)

Loss_term  COLLOCATION  3000  colloc.dat  1.d-2 /

Sys_wcomp  0.688 103.1 8.68 /   1/||y_i||^2 from the data

System 3 12 /
TRM  1  1   1 0   1.d0    /   u_x
TRM  1  2   0 1   1.d0    /   v_y
XUX  2  1 1 1 0   1.d0    /   u * u_x
XUX  2  2 1 0 1   1.d0    /   v * u_y
TRM  2  3   1 0   1.d0    /   p_x  (rho = 1)
TRM  2  1   2 0  -2.5d-2  /   -nu u_xx
TRM  2  1   0 2  -2.5d-2  /   -nu u_yy
XUX  3  1 2 1 0   1.d0    /   u * v_x
XUX  3  2 2 0 1   1.d0    /   v * v_y
TRM  3  3   0 1   1.d0    /   p_y
TRM  3  2   2 0  -2.5d-2  /   -nu v_xx
TRM  3  2   0 2  -2.5d-2  /   -nu v_yy

Hod_K      2 /
1.d0
0.d0
0.d0
Exact_solution 1 /   colloc.dat carries u*, v*, p*

Hod_dense  1 /

Hod_check  0 /
Num_validation 200 /
Validation_cyc 100 /
P_max          20000 /
Epoch      400 /
Activation TANH /
Conv       1.d-14 /
Num_batch  2800 /   full batch (3000 collocation points less the validation split)
Checkpoint_cyc 100000 /
GD_method  LBFGS
GD_param   0. 0. 0. 0. 0. /
